							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I was the first one, with thecklos being a few kills behind me. We grinded together the entire time but he had a few more deaths than I did so took him a little bit longer. I would have liked for us to ding on the same kill, but damn he just dies too much!
