	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11446"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=551" title="View the profile of beckah">beckah</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								An Everquest Player on Rodcet Nife<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=551"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1154.msg11446#msg11446"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1154.msg11446#msg11446">Re: Who was the first one to hit 70 on Rodcet Nife?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> September 28, 2004, 12:14:58 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Haven&#039;t been here in a few days so not sure if it matters but here are the times from my logs. I&#039;m in cst.<br /><br /><br />From when I dinged:<br /><br />[Thu Sep 16 22:25:28 2004] Your faction standing with<br />Hexxt could not possibly get any worse.<br />[Thu Sep 16 22:25:28 2004] Your faction standing with<br />Nihil could not possibly get any better.<br />[Thu Sep 16 22:25:28 2004] You gain party experience!!<br />[Thu Sep 16 22:25:28 2004] You have gained a level!<br />Welcome to level 70!<br />[Thu Sep 16 22:25:28 2004] a kyv sightstalker&#039;s corpse<br />meets the ground with a brutal thud.<br /><br />From not long after Theck dinged:<br /><br />[Thu Sep 16 22:54:47 2004] Players in EverQuest:<br />[Thu Sep 16 22:54:47 2004] ---------------------------<br /><br />[Thu Sep 16 22:54:47 2004] [70 Prelate] Thecklos<br />(Dwarf) &lt;Dol Amroth&gt; ZONE: kodtaz&nbsp; <br />[Thu Sep 16 22:54:47 2004] [70 Plainswalker] Beckah<br />(Wood Elf) &lt;Dol Amroth&gt; ZONE: kodtaz&nbsp; <br />[Thu Sep 16 22:54:47 2004] There are 2 players in<br />EverQuest.<br /><br />Not sure exactly when Zorx dinged, but this is the earliest I see him in the log, but not like I was checking often so not sure of his time:<br /><br />[Fri Sep 17 03:23:14 2004] Players in EverQuest:<br />[Fri Sep 17 03:23:14 2004] ---------------------------<br /><br />[Fri Sep 17 03:23:14 2004] [70 Prelate] Thecklos (Dwarf) &lt;Dol Amroth&gt; ZONE: kodtaz&nbsp; <br />[Fri Sep 17 03:23:14 2004] [70 Plainswalker] Beckah (Wood Elf) &lt;Dol Amroth&gt; ZONE: kodtaz&nbsp; <br />[Fri Sep 17 03:23:14 2004] [70 Natureguard] Zorx (Wood Elf) &lt;Fires of Time&gt; ZONE: potranquility&nbsp; <br />[Fri Sep 17 03:23:14 2004] There are 3 players in EverQuest.<br /><br />Then we camped shortly after this, and at the time there had not been anyone else showing up:<br /><br />[Fri Sep 17 03:53:23 2004] It will take about 5 more seconds to prepare your camp.<br /><br />Not sure exactly how long we were camped for but I know we didn&#039;t get back on till sometime Friday night, and I didn&#039;t turn on my log right away, so I have no idea when or who dinged after we camped that night:<br /><br />[Fri Sep 17 20:17:37 2004] Logging to &#039;eqlog.txt&#039; is now *ON*.<br /><br />I didn&#039;t do a who until&nbsp; later that night and by that time there was several listed:<br /><br />[Fri Sep 17 21:59:49 2004] Players in EverQuest:<br />[Fri Sep 17 21:59:49 2004] ---------------------------<br /><br />[Fri Sep 17 21:59:49 2004] [70 Scourge Knight] Daewood (Dark Elf) &lt;Hegemony&gt; ZONE: wallofslaughter&nbsp; <br />[Fri Sep 17 21:59:49 2004] [70 Natureguard] Zorx (Wood Elf) &lt;Fires of Time&gt; ZONE: vxed&nbsp; <br />[Fri Sep 17 21:59:49 2004] [70 Nemesis] Sneakytheif (Halfling) &lt;Ascent&gt; ZONE: wallofslaughter&nbsp; <br />[Fri Sep 17 21:59:49 2004] [70 Nemesis] Bethe (Barbarian) &lt;Hegemony&gt; ZONE: wallofslaughter&nbsp; <br />[Fri Sep 17 21:59:49 2004] [70 Prelate] Shib (High Elf) &lt;Ascent&gt; ZONE: vxed&nbsp; <br />[Fri Sep 17 21:59:49 2004] [70 Bedazzler] Carbon (Gnome) &lt;Fires of Time&gt; ZONE: vxed&nbsp; <br />[Fri Sep 17 21:59:49 2004] [70 Plainswalker] Beckah (Wood Elf) &lt;Dol Amroth&gt; ZONE: yxtta&nbsp; <br />[Fri Sep 17 21:59:49 2004] [70 Prelate] Thecklos (Dwarf) &lt;Dol Amroth&gt; ZONE: yxtta&nbsp; <br />[Fri Sep 17 21:59:49 2004] There are 8 players in EverQuest.<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
